 sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant React as Video Studio (React)
    participant Backend as Production Flow V2
    participant Tracker as Status Tracker

    User->>React: Upload PDF + Click "Generate"
    React->>Backend: POST /video-generate (PDF + Auth header)
    Backend-->>React: { jobId: "vid_123", status: "processing" }

    Note over User,Tracker: Loop (every 3 seconds)

    loop Polling
        React->>Backend: GET /video-status?jobId=vid_123
        Backend-->>React: { stage: "parsing", progress: 10 }
        React-->>User: Shows "Processing..." with progress bar
    end

    Backend->>Tracker: Pipeline processes PDF...

    React->>Backend: GET /video-status?action=update&stage=storyboard&progress=35
    Backend->>Tracker: GET /video-status?jobId=vid_123
    Tracker-->>Backend: { stage: "storyboard", progress: 35 }
    Backend-->>React: { stage: "storyboard", progress: 35 }
    React-->>User: "Building storyboard..."

    React->>Backend: GET /video-status?action=update&stage=rendering&progress=60
    Backend->>Tracker: GET /video-status?jobId=vid_123
    Tracker-->>Backend: { stage: "rendering", progress: 60 }
    Backend-->>React: { stage: "rendering", progress: 60 }
    React-->>User: "Generating scenes..."

    React->>Backend: GET /video-status?action=update&stage=completed&progress=100
    Backend->>Tracker: GET /video-status?jobId=vid_123
    Tracker-->>Backend: { stage: "completed", progress: 100, videoUrl: "..." }
    Backend-->>React: { stage: "completed", progress: 100, videoUrl: "..." }

    React-->>User: 🎉 Video ready! Shows player